# Test package of main (tools/testpaket.py; format in its header).
#
#   Test     number from the test list in docs/05
#   Machine  falcon, st or beide
#   Source   relative to the root of this worktree
#   Name     8.3, lands in AMBFILES\ beside the game data; - for a folder,
#            a whole build laid over the root of ATARI\
#
# The package always holds main's ATARI/ (game data included).  A test of
# the normal build names it with a folder line, so that it appears in
# TESTS.TXT.
#
# Names the game uses itself (ENGINE, INTRO, EXTRO, FANTASY) get a T
# prefix, unless the test asks for the normal build.  Whoever puts a test
# here leaves its build in place until the date; afterwards the lines go.
#
